cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these results or this code, please cite it as below."
title: "aether-census: what LLM SDKs and gateways do to tool schemas"
abstract: >-
  A census of what LLM SDKs and gateways send to the model provider when you
  give them a JSON Schema tool definition. 28 fixtures with 34 constraint cases
  are captured offline through 19 library and provider paths, and each sent
  schema is checked against the original with a JSON Schema validator.
authors:
